milies?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Durable finishes, concealed storage and easy-care fabrics keep the home luxurious and usable for children, guests and pets.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- /FAQS:auto -->\n\n        <!-- CLOSING SECTION -->\n        <div class=\"closing-section\">\n            <h2>Luxury That Feels Personal</h2>\n            <p>The best homes reflect the people who live in them. Our luxury home interior designs bring that personal touch to even the largest estates. Your home should tell your story, not a showroom's.</p><p>Planning a luxury home in Rajokri? <a href=\"/rajokri/contact\">Book a private consultation with 9th Corner</a>.</p>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n"}